# Did lowering speed limits reduce injury crashes? A spatial before–after evaluation on Victorian open data

[![CI](https://github.com/zeussilver/road-safety-eval/actions/workflows/ci.yml/badge.svg?branch=main)](https://github.com/zeussilver/road-safety-eval/actions/workflows/ci.yml)

**[2-page policy brief](docs/BRIEF.md)** · **[Interactive map](https://zeussilver.github.io/road-safety-eval/)** (treated segments, crashes before and after, Yarra trial streets)

